{"text": "If your child was born on the 8th, the 17th, or the 26th of any month, then a star has arrived in your family. They call them star children.\n\nFrom the moment they are born they carry a different energy. They stand out, and they are very sensitive to how you treat them.\n\nThese children do not answer to force. Raise your voice and they push back harder. But speak to them as an equal, and they will climb higher than you imagined. They need a guide, not a boss.\n\nAnd if you lose patience over small things, if you feel guilty after every argument, it is not that you love them less, my friend. It is that you have been living without peace for too long.\n\nWrite your child's date of birth in the comments if it matches, and follow me for the rest.\n\nBut the calm your child needs can only come from you if you carry it yourself. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "o", "r", "n", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "8", "t", "h", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "1", "7", "t", "h", ",", " ", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "2", "6", "t", "h", " ", "o", "f", " ", "a", "n", "y", " ", "m", "o", "n", "t", "h", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "a", "r", "r", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", ".", "\n", "\n", "F", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "b", "o", "r", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "a", "r", "r", "y", " ", "a", " ", "d", "i", "f", "f", "e", "r", "e", "n", "t", " ", "e", "n", "e", "r", "g", "y", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " 